cff-version: 1.2.0
title: Refusing Membrane
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-10-21
authors:
  - family-names: Brisson
    given-names: Jean-François
    orcid: https://orcid.org/0009-0000-9778-5374
license: AGPL-3.0-only
repository-code: https://github.com/sparkainlp-x/refusing-membrane
abstract: >-
  Selective projection for a complex outer-product holographic
  memory: a calibrated overlap gate refuses out-of-library probes
  instead of misclassifying them. Threshold self-calibrates via
  Youden's J on labeled probes, freezes, and is evaluated on fresh
  seeds, including under distribution shift. Documents the
  coverage-risk trade-off honestly.
keywords:
  - holographic-memory
  - selective-classification
  - out-of-distribution
  - fail-closed
  - wave-computing
